# Datsun Stanza T11 five-door liftback, 1982-1986.
#
# The front-wheel-drive Stanza, which replaced the rear-wheel-drive Violet in
# Britain in January 1982 and stayed until 1986, sold first as the Datsun Stanza
# and later as the Nissan Stanza with 1.6 and 1.8 CA-series engines. British cars
# were five-door liftbacks, which is the body modelled.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nissan_Violet
#
# Dimensions 4.300 x 1.665 x 1.385 m, wheelbase 2.470 m, from the English
# Wikipedia T11 infobox (the saloon is quoted at 4,300-4,405 mm; the liftback
# shares the figures). Mirrors take the modelled width to 1.818 m.
#
# Colours. No UK colour chart for the T11 was located, so the objects carry plain
# colour names: white, red, blue and silver. Weights white 3, red 3, blue 2,
# silver 2, total 10, provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 160 km/h for the 1.6, the volume UK model. Comfort 70/435, on the line
# 330 + 1.5 x 70, the BMC1100's value and a step above the rear-wheel-drive
# Bluebird 910. Classes 0,1,2.
#
# Dates are road presence: January 1982 intro, retires staggered 1998-2001 on a
# fifteen- to nineteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/nissan-stanza-t11.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/nissan-stanza-t11.dae (68 objects). References:
# citycars/references/nissan-stanza-t11/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons; all
# four photographs are UK-market cars with European lamps and slim bumpers).
#
# Recorded limitation: no level side profile of a European T11 exists on
# Commons, so the flank and wheel positions were calibrated from the published
# dimensions rather than measured from a photograph. The achieved length/height
# ratio is 3.105, consistent with a liftback of this size.
#
# Accepted deviations: body and bumper corners are more angular than the
# photographs. At 128 px the liftback tailgate slope, the segmented tail lamps
# and the triangular quarter glass read correctly.

obj=citycar
name=DatsunStanzaT11(White)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=1982
intro_month=1
retire_year=2001
retire_month=6
speed=160
length=3
class=0,1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=70
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=435

